# Task: Ontology - Review

**Priorities**

* Use the [Code Review Template](#template-code-review) to perform an analysis of the current implementation.
    * Do not use every section in the [Code Review Template](#template-code-review) just to fill space. Do not pad the word count of a review with meaningless filler.
* (*Optional*) Use the [Documentation Template](#template-documentaton) to isolate any divergences in the documentation and codebase.
* (*Optional*) Use the [Bug Report Template](#template-bug-report) to raise any issues you find.

**Guidelines: Review**

* identify contradictions
* resolve inconsistencies
* diagnose architectural problems
* suggest improvements
* rethink key systems
* clarify implementation details.

